<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n38911" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιβήτ-ωρ</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ορος</span>,
			ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>one who mounts</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. ἵππων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					18.263
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Simm.
				1.3
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νεὼς</span>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιβήτορα λαόν</span>, 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιβάτας</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				7.498
			</span></i> (Antip.(?)); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. κύκλων</span>, of
			the Trojan horse, <i><span class="en">
				Tryph.
				307
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>. of male
			animals, e.g.a boar, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συῶν</span>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιβήτωρ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					11.131
				</span></i>
			; of a bull, <i><span class="en">
				Theoc.
				25.128
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>. as
				Adj., <i>springing</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Nonn.
				<u>D.</u>
				20.113
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>. metaph.,
				<i>at home in, master of</i> a thing, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θηροδιδασκαλίης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Man.
					4.245
				</span></i>
			; <i>dwelling in</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὕλης
				οὐρανίας κτλ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Orph.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				353
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
